#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/UI/SmartUpgradePanel.cpp(981)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,Upgrade_ClickToSelect"
msgid "Click to select {0} for upgrade"
msgstr "點擊選擇 {0} 進行升級"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/UI/SmartUpgradePanel_Detail.cpp(196)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,Upgrade_Complete"
msgid "Upgrade complete: {0} success, {1} failed, {2} skipped"
msgstr "升級完成: {0} 成功, {1} 失敗, {2} 跳過"

